{"id":9197,"date":"2025-07-05T18:24:17","date_gmt":"2025-07-05T18:24:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=9197"},"modified":"2025-07-15T16:25:41","modified_gmt":"2025-07-15T16:25:41","slug":"what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/","title":{"rendered":"What Colour Clothes Attract Wasps? Outdoor Safety Tips for Melbourne"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2><b>Ever wondered why wasps keep buzzing around you during your Melbourne picnic?<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you&#8217;re hosting a BBQ in your backyard, spending a sunny afternoon at the Royal Botanic Gardens, or tending your veggie patch in the suburbs, wasps always seem to appear just when you least expect them.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">But what if it\u2019s not just the food or drink drawing them in?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What if the colours you&#8217;re wearing are sending wasps a visual invite?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This blog explores how wasps perceive colour, why certain clothing can make you more noticeable to them, and what you can do to stay safe outdoors in Melbourne.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Plus, if you\u2019re noticing more than just a passing visitor, we\u2019ll show you when it\u2019s time to call in expert help with <\/span><b>wasp nest control in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Do Colours Really Attract Wasps?<\/span><\/h3>\n<h2><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-7455\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-03-at-1.23.34-PM-300x205.jpeg\" alt=\"Do Colours Really Attract Wasps? \" width=\"300\" height=\"205\" \/><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The short answer: yes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps have a sophisticated visual system that allows them to detect ultraviolet (UV) light \u2014 something the human eye can\u2019t see.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u00a0This unique ability helps them locate food sources like flowers and fruit.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unfortunately, it also means that your brightly coloured t-shirt or picnic rug might look a lot like a giant nectar source to a wasp.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Unlike humans, who perceive colours based on red, green, and blue cones, wasps perceive the world using UV, blue, and green. That means certain bright colours appear far more vibrant or attractive to wasps, especially those that reflect UV light strongly.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">So while you may think you\u2019re blending into the background in your white sundress, to a wasp you could be glowing like a flower in full bloom.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Colours That Attract Wasps the Most<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Certain colours are far more likely to attract wasps than others. Here are the ones to avoid if you\u2019re heading outdoors during Melbourne\u2019s warmer months:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Yellow<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 This colour closely resembles pollen and flower petals, which are food sources for wasps. Wearing yellow can make you look like a walking bloom.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>White<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 While it may seem like a neutral choice, white reflects UV light very strongly. That makes it highly visible to wasps and other insects that see in the UV spectrum.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Blue<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Especially lighter shades, which can resemble nectar-rich flowers. Insect vision often associates this with food.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Black or Dark Colours<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 These don\u2019t attract wasps as food but are often perceived as threats. Dark clothing can make you look like a predator to wasps, triggering defensive behaviour.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bright and contrasting colours, particularly those that resemble natural sources of nectar or pose a perceived threat, are most likely to draw attention from nearby wasps.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Safe Colours to Wear Outdoors in Melbourne<\/span><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">So what should you wear if you want to enjoy the outdoors without unwanted insect attention?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose colours that are less stimulating to a wasp\u2019s vision. These include:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Muted greens<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Blend in with your natural surroundings and do not resemble flowers.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Beige or khaki<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 Earth-toned colours that don\u2019t reflect UV light strongly.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Brown and other earthy tones<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 These natural colours are generally ignored by wasps.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These clothing choices can help you stay under the radar during outdoor activities in areas like your backyard, city parks, or even a Yarra Valley picnic.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Outdoor Safety Tips for Wasp Prevention in Melbourne<\/span><\/h5>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-7454\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-03-at-2.13.55-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"Outdoor Safety Tips for Wasp Prevention in Melbourne\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While choosing your outfit is a good start, there are several other precautions you can take to avoid attracting wasps while enjoying the outdoors in Melbourne:<\/span><\/p>\n<ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Wear neutral or earthy-coloured clothing<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> As discussed, this helps you avoid drawing attention.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Avoid perfumes or scented body products<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Floral or fruity fragrances can attract wasps, mistaking you for food.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Keep food and drinks covered<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Wasps are drawn to sugary drinks, meats, and fruits \u2013 common at BBQs and picnics.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Use drink containers with lids<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Avoid drinking straight from cans or open bottles, as wasps can crawl inside unnoticed.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Dispose of rubbish promptly<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Especially sweet wrappers, fruit peels, and food scraps.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Remain calm if a wasp approaches<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Sudden movements can startle wasps and provoke them to sting.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Avoid wearing bright accessories<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Hats, bags, and even reflective sunglasses can catch their attention.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When Wasps Become a Bigger Problem<\/span><\/h6>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-7453\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-03-at-2.27.16-PM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\"When Wasps Become a Bigger Problem \" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Occasional wasps during outdoor meals are one thing. But if you notice consistent wasp activity in a specific area of your home or garden, it could indicate something more serious \u2014 a nest nearby.<\/span><\/p>\n<h6><b>Here are signs to watch for:<\/b><\/h6>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Increased wasp traffic around one area<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> If wasps are frequently flying in and out of the same location, there&#8217;s likely a nest.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Buzzing sounds from walls, roofs, or vents<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps often nest inside wall cavities, roof eaves, or behind vents.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Visible nest structures<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> These look like grey, papery hives and can be found under eaves, tree branches, sheds, or fences.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Aggressive wasp behaviour<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps tend to become territorial when they feel their nest is threatened.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why You Should Avoid DIY Wasp Nest Removal<\/span><\/h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While it might be tempting to tackle a wasp nest on your own, the risks often outweigh the rewards.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Here\u2019s why DIY isn\u2019t recommended:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Wasp stings are painful and can trigger allergic reactions<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> For some, a single sting can lead to serious medical emergencies.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Nests contain dozens to hundreds of wasps<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Disturbing a nest without the proper technique or equipment can result in a swarm attack.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Incorrect removal methods can cause structural damage<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Using sprays or smoke near walls, vents, or timber structures can cause harm to your property.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Professionals know how to safely locate and remove nests<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Pest control technicians have protective gear, the right treatments, and experience managing wasp infestations.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Dress Smart, Stay Safe, and Act Fast<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you\u2019ve ever had a picnic or gardening session interrupted by a persistent wasp, now you know why.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">From the colours you wear to the smells you carry and how you handle food outdoors, there\u2019s a lot that can attract these unwelcome guests.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps aren\u2019t just a nuisance \u2014 they can pose real risks, especially when they nest close to where people live, eat, and relax.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\"><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is a trusted name in Melbourne for reliable and affordable pest management. With years of experience, a local team, and fully licensed technicians, they offer safe and tailored pest control services to homes and businesses across Melbourne.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Whether you\u2019re dealing with wasps, termites, ants, or rodents, they bring expert solutions and peace of mind.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you suspect a nest nearby, don\u2019t wait for the problem to escalate.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Book professional<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/wasp-nest-removal-melbourne\/\"> <b>Wasp Nest Control in Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> with 7 States Pest Control.<\/span><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Ever wondered why wasps keep buzzing around you during your Melbourne picnic? Whether you&#8217;re hosting a BBQ in your backyard, spending a sunny afternoon at the Royal Botanic Gardens, or tending your veggie patch in the suburbs, wasps always seem to appear just when you least expect them. But what if it\u2019s not just the [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":9216,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[17],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-9197","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-wasp-nest-removal"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>What Colour Clothes Attract Wasps? | Outdoor Wasp Safety Tips for Melbourne<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Discover how colour influences wasp attraction and learn key tips to stay safe outdoors in Melbourne. Find out when to call expert wasp nest control services near you.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"What Colour Clothes Attract Wasps? | Outdoor Wasp Safety Tips for Melbourne\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Discover how colour influences wasp attraction and learn key tips to stay safe outdoors in Melbourne. Find out when to call expert wasp nest control services near you.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2025-07-05T18:24:17+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:modified_time\" content=\"2025-07-15T16:25:41+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-04-at-12.01.44-PM-1-1.jpeg\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1280\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"672\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/jpeg\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"6 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#article\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"7 States Pest Control\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#\/schema\/person\/d2eebd8e6e8b6f07170a10bc11d3dadb\"},\"headline\":\"What Colour Clothes Attract Wasps? Outdoor Safety Tips for Melbourne\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-07-05T18:24:17+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-07-15T16:25:41+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\"},\"wordCount\":1086,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-04-at-12.01.44-PM-1-1.jpeg\",\"articleSection\":[\"wasp nest removal\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\"},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\",\"name\":\"What Colour Clothes Attract Wasps? | Outdoor Wasp Safety Tips for Melbourne\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-04-at-12.01.44-PM-1-1.jpeg\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-07-05T18:24:17+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-07-15T16:25:41+00:00\",\"description\":\"Discover how colour influences wasp attraction and learn key tips to stay safe outdoors in Melbourne. Find out when to call expert wasp nest control services near you.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-04-at-12.01.44-PM-1-1.jpeg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-07-04-at-12.01.44-PM-1-1.jpeg\",\"width\":1280,\"height\":672,\"caption\":\"melbourne wasp removal\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/what-colour-clothes-attract-wasps-outdoor-safety-tips-for-melbourne\/#breadcrumb\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"What Colour Clothes Attract Wasps? Outdoor Safety Tips for Melbourne\"}]},{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#website\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\",\"name\":\"7 States Pest Control\",\"description\":\"\",\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#organization\"},\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":{\"@type\":\"EntryPoint\",\"urlTemplate\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?s={search_term_string}\"},\"query-input\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValueSpecification\",\"valueRequired\":true,\"valueName\":\"search_term_string\"}}],\"inL